      "content": "wait, what are you talking about with the goblins? lol \n\nand the code you sent is identical to the one i sent you first. i already have the policy attached to the lambda role, that's why i'm asking why it's still failing. \n\ncan you just focus on the technical side? if the PutObject permission is there and the resource ARN is correct, what else could be causing 'Access Denied'?",
